lvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯发布HY-Embodied-0.5具身模型，22项评测中16项刷新行业纪录</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">教育部等五部门印发《“人工智能+教育”行动计划》并开发全学段AI慕课</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta发布Muse Spark模型，推动Meta AI应用跃升至App Store第五名</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">西门子联手英伟达优化AI芯片验证流程，将前硅设计验证周期从数月缩短至数日</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8ba88b9d91febbbc7bd322b257d80990.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">西门子与英伟达近日宣布在AI芯片验证领域达成深度合作，通过软硬协同技术大幅提升芯片前硅设计验证效率。双方利用西门子Veloce™ proFPGA CS硬件辅助验证系统，结合英伟达深度优化的芯片架构，成功将原本耗时数月的数万亿次前硅设计周期验证缩短至数日内完成。该方案允许英伟达在首版芯片交付制造前，运行大规模真实工作负载并进行针对性设计优化。此举不仅能显著缩短新一代AI芯片的上市时间（TTM），还能通过在硅前阶段的大规模负载模拟，有效提升流片成功率并规避高昂的返工成本。作为西门子EDA工具链在AI产业链底层的深度应用，该验证系统通过数字化孪生技术，为英伟达追求极致算力密度的芯片设计提供了关键的稳定性保障，为AI算力集群的快速落地提供了底层技术支撑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁集团斩获CVPR 2026两项冠军，实现AIGC检测技术实战级跃迁</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b6a01cf851f6683de7de460ae590134a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">蚂蚁集团在计算机视觉顶会CVPR 2026 NTIRE挑战赛中，斩获“复杂真实场景鲁棒性样本测试”与“人脸增强异常检测”双赛道冠军。针对Deepfake与AIGC滥用风险，蚂蚁AI安全实验室基于DINOv3视觉基础模型，提出双流并行集成架构，通过模拟多重失真全链路退化效果，显著提升了模型在真实场景下的鲁棒性。团队创新的“Locate-Then-Examine”两阶段检测范式，实现了从“黑盒”判断到“可定位、可解释”的突破，并构建了FakeXplained数据集。该技术已应用于支付、金融身份认证及EKYC等场景，有效防范AIGC攻击。此外，蚂蚁集团已在GitHub开源相关检测资源仓库，助力行业共同应对深度伪造挑战。此次夺冠标志着蚂蚁集团在AI安全领域的技术能力已从实验室环境成功跨越至高复杂度的真实业务场景。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯发布HY-Embodied-0.5具身模型，22项评测中16项刷新行业纪录</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8463332e50e07be255cca58cf0c03ac7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯Robotics X实验室联合混元团队正式发布专为具身智能打造的HY-Embodied-0.5基础模型，旨在解决通用VLM在三维空间感知与物理交互上的短板。该系列包含MoT-2B（4B参数，2B激活）与MoE-32B（407B参数，32B激活）两款模型，采用首创的视觉与语言模态非共享参数的混合Transformer架构，并配合HY-ViT2.0视觉编码器。模型基于超1亿条具身专属数据训练，引入拒绝采样微调、强化学习及在线蒸馏等后训练策略。性能方面，MoT-2B在22项感知、推理及规划评测中斩获16项最佳，超越Qwen3-VL-4B等同参数竞品；MoE-32B则具备与Gemini3.0Pro抗衡的综合性能。实机测试显示，该模型在打包、堆叠等任务中表现优异，为具身智能从虚拟仿真向物理实操落地提供了高性能底层基座</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">教育部等五部门印发《“人工智能+教育”行动计划》并开发全学段AI慕课</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6eed16a7e538262afb05d56267905cf5.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">教育部、国家发展改革委、工业和信息化部、科技部及国家数据局联合印发《“人工智能+教育”行动计划》，正式启动国家级全学段AI慕课资源开发。该计划旨在构建全民AI素养培育机制，通过体系化教育重塑劳动力结构。在实施路径上，基础教育阶段将AI课程设为地方必修课，高等教育将AI纳入公共基础课程体系并增设微专业，职业教育则侧重高技能人才培养。国家智慧教育平台将上线免费AI通识课，集成智能导学、个性化路径规划及AI伴学等技术，以数字化手段弥合城乡教育资源差距。此举标志着我国AI人才培养进入体系化阶段，目标在2030年前将人工智能转化为社会基础性技能，为全球AI竞争储备人才池与应用生态基础。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta发布Muse Spark模型，推动Meta AI应用跃升至App Store第五名</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4f4fe424bc7d4464a7e82b11016ac757.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta正式发布由Alexandr Wang领导的超级智能实验室开发的Muse Spark模型，该模型支持语音、文本和图像多模态输入，具备复杂领域解答及视觉编程能力，并支持多子代理协同处理任务。受此驱动，Meta AI应用在美国App Store排名从第57名跃升至第5名。Appfigures数据显示，发布首日Meta AI在美国iOS平台下载量达4.6万次，环比增长87%。目前，Meta AI全球总下载量已达6050万，印度为最大市场。Meta计划将Muse Spark陆续集成至WhatsApp、Instagram、Facebook、Messenger及AI眼镜等平台。尽管下载量激增，其排名仍落后于ChatGPT、Claude和Gemini。此外，4月8日Meta AI美国日均网站访问量激增超450%，创下历</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
